# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Signing material — belongs in GitHub Secrets, never in git.
# CI enforces this too: "Assert no signing secrets are committed".
# If one of these ever does get committed, removing it is not enough — revoke and
# reissue the credential in Apple Developer / App Store Connect.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.p8
*.p12
*.pfx
*.mobileprovision
*.provisionprofile
*.cer
*.certSigningRequest
*.pem
*.key
*.keystore
*.jks
ExportOptions.plist
private_keys/

# macOS
.DS_Store
